[gd_scene load_steps=6 format=3 uid="uid://cwaynabburn01"]

; Wayna's bburn missile -- a thrown LobProjectile (root) that arcs to the NEAREST enemy, dwells a
; beat (dodge window), then erupts into wayna_blast. The director spawns this on the throw frame and
; sets its target + explosion damage (from moves.gd) -- see ParticleDirector._launch_lob. hostile
; stays false (a friendly bomb: it hurts enemies, not Wayna). Fiery Core + trail for her palette.

